#23rd Code Challange Ola Ride Complaint Analysis

## 📌 Overview

This project analyzes ride complaint data using only string operations in Python.

## 🎯 Objectives

* Clean raw string data
* Count total complaints
* Identify frequent issues
* Analyze complaints by city
* Standardize issue names

## 🛠️ Tools Used

* Python
* String Functions

## 📂 Dataset

Data is provided as a single string containing:
Ride ID, Driver Name, Issue, City

## ⚙️ Process

* Converted data to lowercase
* Split records using comma
* Counted occurrences of issues
* Extracted driver names
* Replaced inconsistent issue names

## 📈 Results

* Total Complaints: 3
* Late Arrival Issues: 2
* Bangalore Complaints: 2

## 🧠 Learning

* Data cleaning fundamentals
* String manipulation
* Handling unstructured data

## 🔚 Conclusion

This project demonstrates how basic string operations can be used to extract insights from raw data.
